#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:4
msgid "Сигналы"
msgstr "Signals"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:6
msgid "Содержание"
msgstr "Contents"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:8
msgid ""
":ref:`События Citeck <bpmn_events_integrations>` реализуются через "
"сигналы. Каждый сигнал — глобальное событие, передающееся всем активным "
"обработчикам."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Citeck Events <bpmn_events_integrations>` are implemented through "
"signals. Each signal is a global event delivered to all active handlers."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:10
msgid "Сигналы типов Throw и Catch выполняются по имени сигнала."
msgstr "Throw and Catch signals are executed by signal name."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:13
msgid "Определение событий (сигналов)"
msgstr "Event (Signal) Definitions"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:16
msgid "Форма"
msgstr "Form"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:23
msgid "Атрибуты"
msgstr "Attributes"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:30
msgid "**Ручная настройка**"
msgstr "**Manual Configuration**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:31
msgid ""
"Флаг, который позволяет переключить настройку сигнала в ручной режим — "
"указание имени сигнала, а не выбор из предустановленных типов событий."
msgstr ""
"A flag that allows switching signal configuration to manual mode — "
"specifying the signal name instead of selecting from predefined event "
"types."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:32
msgid "**Имя сигнала**"
msgstr "**Signal Name**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Служит для идентификации сигнала."
msgstr "Used to identify the signal."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Данное поле становится доступно если включена опция ``Ручная настройка``."
msgstr ""
"This field becomes available if the ``Manual Configuration`` option is "
"enabled."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Если выбран ``тип события``, то имя генерируется автоматически."
msgstr "If an ``event type`` is selected, the name is generated automatically."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:36
msgid "**Модель данных**"
msgstr "**Data Model**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Каждое событие имеет свою полезную нагрузку (payload)."
msgstr "Each event has its own payload."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"Например, событие ``Статус изменен`` содержит информацию о новом и "
"предыдущем статусе."
msgstr ""
"For example, the ``Status Changed`` event contains information about the "
"new and previous status."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"Модель данных представляет собой ``map``, где ``ключ`` — имя атрибута, по"
" которому будет доступно вычисленное значение, а ``значение`` — "
":ref:`Records API атрибут <Records API attribute>`."
msgstr ""
"The data model is a ``map`` where the ``key`` is the attribute name by "
"which the computed value will be accessible, and the ``value`` is a "
":ref:`Records API attribute <Records API attribute>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"Таким образом, модель данных позволяет указать какие данные будут "
"передаваться в сигнале, при этом пользовательская модель данных имеет "
"высший приоритет над :ref:`payload по умолчанию "
"<ecos_bpmn_signal_event_defaut_payload>`."
msgstr ""
"Thus, the data model allows specifying which data will be transmitted in "
"the signal, with the custom data model having the highest priority over "
"the :ref:`default payload <ecos_bpmn_signal_event_defaut_payload>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:41
msgid "**Фильтр события по документу**"
msgstr "**Event Filter by Document**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"Позволяет отфильтровать события на основе документа, по которому "
"возникает данное событие."
msgstr "Allows filtering events based on the document for which this event occurs."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Поле имеет 3 значения:"
msgstr "The field has 3 values:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:45
msgid "``Любой документ`` — событие будет происходить для любого документа."
msgstr "``Any document`` — the event will occur for any document."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:46
msgid ""
"``Текущий документ`` — событие будет происходить только для документа по "
"которому идет бизнес процесс."
msgstr ""
"``Current document`` — the event will occur only for the document "
"associated with the business process."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:47
msgid ""
"``Документ из переменной процесса`` — событие будет возникать только для "
"документа, который указан в поле ``Имя переменной``."
msgstr ""
"``Document from process variable`` — the event will occur only for the "
"document specified in the ``Variable Name`` field."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:49
msgid "**Имя переменной**"
msgstr "**Variable Name**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"Поле становится доступно, если в ``Фильтр события по документу`` выбрано "
"значение ``Документ из переменной процесса``."
msgstr ""
"The field becomes available if the value ``Document from process "
"variable`` is selected in ``Event Filter by Document``."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"В данном поле указывается имя переменной процесса, по которой будет "
"определяться документ, для которого будет возникать событие."
msgstr ""
"This field specifies the name of the process variable that will determine"
" the document for which the event will occur."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Переменная должна содержать EntityRef документа в виде String."
msgstr "The variable must contain the document's EntityRef as a String."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:53
msgid "**Фильтр события по предикатам**"
msgstr "**Event Filter by Predicates**"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid "Используется для фильтрации catch событий."
msgstr "Used for filtering catch events."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ""
"Моделью для вычисления предиката является payload события. В предикатах "
"можно ссылаться на атрибуты из payload события через "
"``{{someAttribute}}``. Если атрибут используется только в предикате, то "
"его можно использовать напрямую без объявления в модели."
msgstr ""
"The model for predicate evaluation is the event payload. In predicates, "
"you can reference attributes from the event payload using "
"``{{someAttribute}}``. If an attribute is used only in the predicate, it "
"can be used directly without declaration in the model."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst
msgid ":ref:`Подробнее о предикатах <ecos-predicate_main>`"
msgstr ":ref:`More about predicates <ecos-predicate_main>`"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:60
msgid ""
"При сохранении, сохранении/публикации процесса проверяется обязательность"
" заполнения следующих полей:"
msgstr ""
"When saving or saving/publishing the process, the mandatory filling of "
"the following fields is checked:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:62
msgid "**«Тип события»**, если поле «Ручная настройка» = false;"
msgstr "**'Event Type'**, if the 'Manual Configuration' field = false;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:63
msgid "**«Имя сигнала»**, если поле «Ручная настройка» = true;"
msgstr "**'Signal Name'**, if the 'Manual Configuration' field = true;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:64
msgid "**«Фильтр события по документу»**;"
msgstr "**'Event Filter by Document'**;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:65
msgid ""
"**«Имя переменной»**, если поле «Фильтр события по документу» = «Документ"
" из переменной процесса»;"
msgstr ""
"**'Variable Name'**, if the 'Event Filter by Document' field = 'Document "
"from process variable';"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:66
msgid ""
"**«Фильтр события по типу документа»** или **«Фильтр события по "
"предикатам»**, если «Тип события» = «Record создан»"
msgstr ""
"**'Event Filter by Document Type'** or **'Event Filter by Predicates'**, "
"if 'Event Type' = 'Record created'"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:68
msgid "Иначе в :ref:`линтере <bpmn_linter>` будет выдана ошибка."
msgstr "Otherwise, an error will be issued in the :ref:`linter <bpmn_linter>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:73
msgid "Payload событий"
msgstr "Event Payloads"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:75
msgid "Пример payload события **Статус изменен**"
msgstr "Example payload for the **Status Changed** event"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:92
msgid "Payload по умолчанию для всех событий"
msgstr "Default Payload for All Events"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:94
msgid "Каждое событие имеет payload по умолчанию, который содержит:"
msgstr "Every event has a default payload that contains:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:96
msgid "``_meta`` — мета информация о событии. Содержит:"
msgstr "``_meta`` — meta information about the event. Contains:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:98
msgid "``id`` — уникальный идентификатор события (UUID)"
msgstr "``id`` — unique event identifier (UUID)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:100
msgid "``type`` — тип события (String)"
msgstr "``type`` — event type (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:102
msgid "``time`` — время возникновения события (Instant)"
msgstr "``time`` — time the event occurred (Instant)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:104
msgid "``user`` — username пользователя, который вызвал событие (String)"
msgstr "``user`` — username of the user who triggered the event (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:105
msgid "``record`` — документ по которому произошло событие (EntityRef)"
msgstr "``record`` — the document for which the event occurred (EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:106
msgid "``recordType`` — тип документа по которому произошло событие (EntityRef)"
msgstr ""
"``recordType`` — the type of document for which the event occurred "
"(EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:110
msgid ""
"По соглашению, каждое событие должно содержать атрибут ``record`` в виде "
"EntityRef. Если событие не содержит этого поля, то фильтрация по "
"документу не будет работать."
msgstr ""
"By convention, every event should contain a ``record`` attribute as an "
"EntityRef. If the event does not contain this field, filtering by "
"document will not work."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:113
msgid "Payload по умолчанию для предопределенных событий"
msgstr "Default Payload for Predefined Events"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:116
msgid "Record создан"
msgstr "Record Created"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:118
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:123
msgid "Дополнительная модель отсутствует."
msgstr "No additional model."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:121
msgid "Record удален"
msgstr "Record Deleted"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:126
msgid "Record изменен"
msgstr "Record Changed"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:128
msgid "``before`` — атрибуты до изменения (Map<String, Any>)"
msgstr "``before`` — attributes before the change (Map<String, Any>)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:129
msgid "``after`` — атрибуты после изменения (Map<String, Any>)"
msgstr "``after`` — attributes after the change (Map<String, Any>)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:130
msgid ""
"``diff`` — объект описывающий изменения (`Diff <https://github.com/Citeck"
"/ecos-events/blob/master/ecos-"
"events2/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/events2/type/RecordEventTypes.kt>`_)"
msgstr ""
"``diff`` — an object describing the changes (`Diff "
"<https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-events/blob/master/ecos-"
"events2/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/events2/type/RecordEventTypes.kt>`_)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:132
msgid ""
"``list`` — список изменений (List<`DiffValue <https://github.com/Citeck"
"/ecos-events/blob/master/ecos-"
"events2/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/events2/type/RecordEventTypes.kt>`_>),"
" например *diff.list?json*"
msgstr ""
"``list`` — list of changes (List<`DiffValue <https://github.com/Citeck"
"/ecos-events/blob/master/ecos-"
"events2/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/events2/type/RecordEventTypes.kt>`_>),"
" e.g., *diff.list?json*"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:134
msgid ""
"``has`` — предоставляет возможность проверить был ли изменен атрибут "
"(Boolean), например *diff._has.youAttName?bool*"
msgstr ""
"``has`` — provides the ability to check if an attribute was changed "
"(Boolean), e.g., *diff._has.youAttName?bool*"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:137
msgid "Статус изменен"
msgstr "Status Changed"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:155
msgid "**Тип изменения**:"
msgstr "**Change Type**:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:157
msgid "**Предыдущий** — статус до изменения;"
msgstr "**Previous** — status before the change;"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:158
msgid "**Новый** — статус после изменения."
msgstr "**New** — status after the change."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:160
msgid ""
"**Статус** выбирается из выпадающего списка. Список статусов формируется "
"из привязанного типа данных."
msgstr ""
"**Status** is selected from a dropdown list. The list of statuses is "
"formed from the associated data type."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:164
msgid "Комментарий создан"
msgstr "Comment Created"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:166
msgid "``text`` — текст комментария (String)"
msgstr "``text`` — comment text (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:167
#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:174
msgid "``commentRecord`` — рекорд созданного комментария (EntityRef)"
msgstr "``commentRecord`` — record of the created comment (EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:170
msgid "Комментарий изменен"
msgstr "Comment Changed"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:172
msgid "``textBefore`` — текст комментария до изменения (String)"
msgstr "``textBefore`` — comment text before the change (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:173
msgid "``textAfter`` — текст комментария после изменения (String)"
msgstr "``textAfter`` — comment text after the change (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:177
msgid "Комментарий удален"
msgstr "Comment Deleted"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:179
msgid "``text`` — текст удаленного комментария (String)"
msgstr "``text`` — text of the deleted comment (String)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:180
msgid "``commentRecord`` — рекорд удаленного комментария (EntityRef)"
msgstr "``commentRecord`` — record of the deleted comment (EntityRef)"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:185
msgid "Пользовательское действие"
msgstr "User Action"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:187
msgid "Реализована возможность из виджета «Действия» тригерить Citeck-events."
msgstr ""
"The ability to trigger Citeck-events from the 'Actions' widget has been "
"implemented."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:191
msgid ""
"Предварительно создайте действия с типом :ref:`user-event "
"<user_event_action>`"
msgstr "First, create actions with the type :ref:`user-event <user_event_action>`."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:193
msgid ""
"При выборе типа **Пользовательское действие** появляется возможность "
"выбора действий из выпадающего списка."
msgstr ""
"When the **User Action** type is selected, the ability to choose actions "
"from a dropdown list appears."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:199
msgid ""
"При этом работает стандартный функционал фильтрации эвентов, позволяющий "
"фильтровать события:"
msgstr ""
"The standard event filtering functionality works, allowing events to be "
"filtered:"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:206
msgid "Использование payload события в Script Task"
msgstr "Using Event Payload in Script Task"

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:208
msgid ""
"После возникновении события, его payload доступен в переменной ``event`` "
"в рамках текущей транзакции. Если необходимо сохранить какую-то "
"информацию из payload в execution процесса, то это можно осуществить "
"через обычное сохранение переменных в execution."
msgstr ""
"After an event occurs, its payload is available in the ``event`` variable"
" within the current transaction. If it is necessary to save some "
"information from the payload into the process execution, this can be done"
" through the usual saving of variables into the execution."

#: ../../settings_kb/processes/ecos_bpmn/editor/components/events/ecos_bpmn_components_signal.rst:210
msgid ""
"Переменная ``event``, это класс-обертка `BpmnDataValue "
"<https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"process/blob/master/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/engine/camunda/impl/variables/convert/BpmnDataValue.kt>`_,"
" который позволяет удобно работать с json представлением данных - "
"безопасно обращаться к полям, получать значения по умолчанию, приводить к"
" нужному типу и многое другое, подробнее см. методы класса."
msgstr ""
"The ``event`` variable is a wrapper class `BpmnDataValue "
"<https://github.com/Citeck/ecos-"
"process/blob/master/src/main/java/ru/citeck/ecos/process/domain/bpmn/engine/camunda/impl/variables/convert/BpmnDataValue.kt>`_"
" that allows convenient work with JSON data representation — safely "
"accessing fields, getting default values, casting to the desired type, "
"and much more; see the class methods for details."

